# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Output Latch
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
wire UM2.11 UC4.8
net EDB7: UM2.18
net EDB6: UM2.3
net EDB5: UM2.17
net EDB4: UM2.4
net EDB3: UM2.8
net EDB2: UM2.13
net EDB1: UM2.7
net EDB0: UM2.14
net MOTOR EN: UM2.19 UF4.1 UF5.1
net SOUND ENABLE: UM2.16 UH4.9 UH5.9 UL4.12
net ENGINE REV EN: UM2.5 UL4.13
net SHELL L/S: UM2.9 UL4.6
net SHELL EN: UM2.12 UJ3.12
net EXPLO L/S: UM2.6 UL4.5
# Two names on one net: SAEN2,3 is declared first because it is the label the
# redrawn schematic carries.
net SAEN2,3: SA.10 UM2.15
net EXPLO EN: UM2.15 UJ3.13
net START LED: UM2.2 P2.7
net /ERESET: P2.V UM2.1 R38.1
net +5V: R38.2
value R38 1K

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Power Input
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
net +5V: P2.21 P2.2 P2.B C27.1 R37.1 R45.1 TP1.1 R3.2 R22.2
net GND: P2.1 P2.A P2.Z P2.22 C27.2 CR2.1 TP2.1 SA.1 P2.E
# CR2: anode (pin 2) from R37, cathode (pin 1) to ground
wire R37.2 CR2.2
net LED PWR: R45.2 P2.Y
net +22V: P2.3 P2.X C28.1 TP3.1 UK5.4 UM5.4
net GND: C28.2
value C27 100uF
value C28 470uF
value R37 150
value R45 150
value R3 1K
value R22 1K
value CR2 MV5053
# Bypass: C1-8, C10, C12, C15-19, C23, C24, C26, all .1, +5V to GND. The sheet
# draws one and lists the rest; where each sits is not drawn.
net +5V: C1.1 C2.1 C3.1 C4.1 C5.1 C6.1 C7.1 C8.1 C10.1 C12.1 C15.1 C16.1 C17.1 C18.1 C19.1 C23.1 C24.1 C26.1
net GND: C1.2 C2.2 C3.2 C4.2 C5.2 C6.2 C7.2 C8.2 C10.2 C12.2 C15.2 C16.2 C17.2 C18.2 C19.2 C23.2 C24.2 C26.2
value C1 .1uF
value C2 .1uF
value C3 .1uF
value C4 .1uF
value C5 .1uF
value C6 .1uF
value C7 .1uF
value C8 .1uF
value C10 .1uF
value C12 .1uF
value C15 .1uF
value C16 .1uF
value C17 .1uF
value C18 .1uF
value C19 .1uF
value C23 .1uF
value C24 .1uF
value C26 .1uF

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Control Panel Inputs -- each switch: 470 pull-up, 1K series, .1 to ground
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
net START: P2.13 R43.1 R51.1
net FIRE: P2.12 R44.1 R52.1
net L-FOR: P2.15 R41.1 R49.1
net L-REV: P2.14 R42.1 R50.1
net R-FOR: P2.17 R39.1 R47.1
net R-REV: P2.16 R40.1 R48.1
net +5V: R39.2 R40.2 R41.2 R42.2 R43.2 R44.2
wire R51.2 C34.1 UB/C2.11
wire R52.2 C35.1 UB/C2.10
wire R49.2 C32.1 UB/C2.13
wire R50.2 C33.1 UB/C2.12
wire R47.2 C30.1 UB/C2.15
wire R48.2 C31.1 UB/C2.14
net GND: C30.2 C31.2 C32.2 C33.2 C34.2 C35.2
value R39 470
value R40 470
value R41 470
value R42 470
value R43 470
value R44 470
value R47 1K
value R48 1K
value R49 1K
value R50 1K
value R51 1K
value R52 1K
value C30 .1uF
value C31 .1uF
value C32 .1uF
value C33 .1uF
value C34 .1uF
value C35 .1uF

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# POKEY (B/C2, C012294-01)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
net +5V: UB/C2.17
net GND: UB/C2.1
net EDB7: UB/C2.6
net EDB6: UB/C2.5
net EDB5: UB/C2.4
net EDB4: UB/C2.3
net EDB3: UB/C2.2
net EDB2: UB/C2.40
net EDB1: UB/C2.39
net EDB0: UB/C2.38
net EPHI2: UB/C2.7
net ER/WB: UB/C2.32
net /SWITCHES: UB/C2.30
wire UB/C2.31 R3.1
net EAB3: UB/C2.33
net EAB2: UB/C2.34
net EAB1: UB/C2.35
net EAB0: UB/C2.36
nc UB/C2.9 UB/C2.8
# Serial out looped back to serial in, pulled up
wire UB/C2.28 UB/C2.24 R46.1
net +5V: R46.2 R36.2
value R46 1K
# POKEY audio: every sound the board does not make itself
net POKEY SOUND: UB/C2.37 R36.1 C25.1 R27.1
net GND: C25.2
value R36 10K
value C25 .015uF

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Noise generator -- 16-bit shift register H5 -> H4, clocked at E12KHZ / 2
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
net E12KHZ: UB4.12
wire UB4.9 UB4.14 UB4.13 UH5.8 UH4.8
wire UB4.11 UB4.15 R22.1
nc UB4.10
wire UH5.13 UH4.1 UH4.2
wire UE5.3 UH5.1 UH5.2
wire UH5.6 UE5.5
wire UH4.12 UJ4.13 UE5.4
wire UH4.11 UJ4.12
wire UH4.10 UJ4.10
wire UH4.6 UJ4.9
wire UE5.6 UE5.2
wire UE5.1 R22.1
nc UH4.5 UH4.4 UH4.3 UH5.12 UH5.11 UH5.10 UH5.5 UH5.4 UH5.3
# J5 makes the shell and explosion noise gates
wire UH4.13 UJ5.11
wire UJ5.12 UJ5.8 UJ3.6
wire UJ4.8 UJ5.3
wire UJ5.2 UJ5.6 UJ3.5
wire UJ5.10 UJ5.13 UJ5.4 UJ5.1 R22.1
nc UJ5.9 UJ5.5

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Shell sound
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
net GND: UL4.8
wire UL4.9 R12.1 R13.1
net GND: R12.2
wire R13.2 C21.1 R32.1 UK5.9
net SHELL SOUND: UK5.8 C21.2 R32.2 R25.1
net +5V: UJ3.11
wire UJ3.10 C9.1 UJ3.8
net GND: C9.2
wire UJ3.9 R14.1
wire R14.2 R15.1 UK5.10
net GND: R15.2
value R12 33K
value R13 10K
value C21 .0047uF
value R32 330K
value C9 4.7uF
value R14 22K
value R15 1K

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Explosion sound
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
net GND: UL4.4
wire UL4.3 R19.1 R18.1
net GND: R19.2
wire R18.2 C22.1 R33.1 UK5.2
net EXPLOSION SOUND: UK5.1 C22.2 R33.2 R28.1
net +5V: UJ3.1
wire UJ3.2 C14.1 UJ3.4
net GND: C14.2
wire UJ3.3 R17.1
wire R17.2 R16.1 UK5.3
net GND: R16.2
value R19 33K
value R18 10K
value C22 .0047uF
value R33 330K
value C14 10uF
value R17 22K
value R16 1K

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Engine sound -- F3 555 sets the rate, ENGINE REV EN ramps it through K5's
# follower into pin 5; F4 (/12) and F5 (/10) divide it, held by MOTOR EN
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
net GND: UL4.1
wire UL4.2 R5.1
# CR1 points from N1 to R9: anode (KiCad pin 2) on the R5/R7 node
wire R5.2 R6.1 R7.1 R8.1 CR1.2
net GND: R6.2
net +5V: R7.2
wire CR1.1 R9.1
wire R8.2 R9.2 C13.1 UK5.5
net GND: C13.2
wire UK5.6 UK5.7 UF3.5
value R5 1K
value R6 4.7K
value R7 1K
value R8 100K
value R9 22K
value C13 10uF
value CR1 1N914
net +5V: UF3.8 UF3.4 R10.1
net GND: UF3.1
# R11 is a 250K pot used as a rheostat: wiper (pin 2) tied to its top end
wire R10.2 R11.1 R11.2 UF3.7
wire R11.3 UF3.6 UF3.2 C11.1
net GND: C11.2
value R10 100K
value R11 250K
value C11 .015uF  # .015 MYL on the 1st printing; the 2nd's fold hides the last digit
wire UF3.3 UF4.2 UF5.2
wire UF4.7 UF4.10 UF5.7 UF5.10 UF4.5 UF5.4 UF5.5 R22.1
net GND: UF4.3 UF4.4 UF4.6 UF5.3 UF5.6
wire UF4.15 UE4.1 R21.1
wire UE4.2 UF4.9
wire UF5.15 UE4.3 R35.1
wire UE4.4 UF5.9
wire UF4.11 R20.1
wire UF5.11 R34.1
net ENGINE SOUND: R20.2 R21.2 R34.2 R35.2 C29.1 R26.1
net GND: C29.2
nc UF4.14 UF4.13 UF4.12 UF5.14 UF5.13 UF5.12
value R20 33K
value R21 33K
value R34 33K
value R35 33K
value C29 .47uF

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mixer and output -- SOUND ENABLE switches the mix into K5, which drives AUD+;
# M5 inverts it for AUD-
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
wire R25.2 R28.2 R26.2 R27.2 UL4.10
wire UL4.11 R29.1 UK5.12
net GND: R29.2
wire UK5.13 R30.1 R31.1
net GND: R30.2
net AUD+: UK5.14 R31.2 C20.1 TP4.1 P2.5
wire C20.2 R24.1
wire R24.2 R23.1 UM5.13
net +5V: UM5.12
net AUD-: UM5.14 R23.2 TP5.1 P2.6
net GND: UK5.11 UM5.11
value R25 100K
value R28 100K
value R26 33K
value R27 330K
value R29 22K
value R30 10K
value R31 100K
value C20 .1uF
value R24 100K
value R23 100K

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pins the sheet does not draw at all. Unused as far as the drawing says; a
# spare gate's inputs may still be tied somewhere on the PCB that the
# schematic does not show.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
nc UC5.5
# SA header pin 2 has no circle on the sheet
nc SA.2
nc UC4.1 UC4.2 UC4.3
nc UE3.4 UE3.5 UE3.6
nc UM5.1 UM5.2 UM5.3 UM5.5 UM5.6 UM5.7 UM5.8 UM5.9 UM5.10
# Slice status outputs: F=0, G and P on all four, Cn+4 out of the top slice,
# and F3/OVR on the three that are not the top slice
nc UK2.11 UK2.32 UK2.33 UK2.35
nc UF2.11 UF2.31 UF2.32 UF2.34 UF2.35
nc UH/J2.11 UH/J2.31 UH/J2.32 UH/J2.34 UH/J2.35
nc UD/E2.11 UD/E2.31 UD/E2.32 UD/E2.34 UD/E2.35
# POKEY keyboard scan, serial clocks and IRQ
nc UB/C2.16 UB/C2.18 UB/C2.19 UB/C2.20 UB/C2.21 UB/C2.22 UB/C2.23 UB/C2.25 UB/C2.26 UB/C2.27 UB/C2.29
# Edge-connector positions the sheet does not use
nc P2.4 P2.8 P2.9 P2.10 P2.11 P2.18 P2.19 P2.20
nc P2.C P2.D P2.F P2.H P2.J P2.K P2.L P2.M P2.N P2.P P2.R P2.S P2.T P2.U P2.W
